students.body:
Hi {{name}},

A quick placement tip: send a slightly different resume for each role. Same facts, but the words that role asks for.

CVTara keeps one primary resume and makes a tailored version for each job in a click, with fresher designs from the guided template library and a matching cover letter.

{{tara_line}}

[button: Make my job-ready resume | {{site_url}}]

Friends applying too? Send them the check on WhatsApp: {{share_url}}

colleges.body:
Hello {{name}},

Following up on my note. Here is the link your students can use straight away: {{ats_url}}

If it helps, we can also run a 30-minute online session for the batch on writing a resume that passes ATS screening, at no cost to the college.

Would a date in the next two weeks suit you? A one-line reply is enough.

{{sender_name}}

Hello {{name}},

I don't want to fill your inbox, so this is my last note. If the ATS check or a resume session would help {{college}}'s students this season, just reply and I'll set it up.

You can also forward the check to your students on WhatsApp: {{share_url}}

{{sender_name}}
